---
description: Core engineering defaults for this repo
alwaysApply: true
---

- Prefer minimal diffs over broad refactors.
- Do not rewrite whole files unless necessary.
- Preserve existing architecture unless the task explicitly requests redesign.
- Ask before making risky, cross-module, or destructive changes.
- When editing code, explain changed files briefly and why.
- Prefer targeted tests/linting over full-suite runs unless needed.
- When requirements are ambiguous, ask clarifying questions first.
